            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.33

- Stops interrupted Codex Desktop resume sessions from staying marked as running when the session file missed the terminal event.
- Prevents stale active session files from reviving a completed thread after newer terminal activity has already been recorded.
